  "sourceTitle": "Wilted Lettuce Salad Dressing",
  "sourceText": "Wilted Lettuce Salad Dressing\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, February 25, 2010 - 11:55pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n6 slices bacon\n1 beaten egg\n1/4 cup green onion\n2 tablespoons sugar\n1 teaspoon salt\n cup red wine vinegar\n2 tablespoons water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Fry bacon and remove. Add onions to grease. Fry and remove pan from heat. Add rest of ingredients and cook until thickened. Add bacon. Pour over leaf lettuce. This is a delicious wilted lettuce recipe!",
  "parsedSource": {
    "ingredients": [
      {
        "sourceText": "6 slices bacon"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1 beaten egg"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1/4 cup green onion"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "2 tablespoons sugar"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1 teaspoon salt"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "cup red wine vinegar"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "2 tablespoons water"
      }
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "text": "1 Fry bacon and remove. Add onions to grease. Fry and remove pan from heat. Add rest of ingredients and cook until thickened. Add bacon. Pour over leaf lettuce. This is a delicious wilted lettuce recipe!"
      }
    ]
  }
